00:30:06.291 --> 00:30:08.625
Aku memberi pengaruh, aku seorang influenser

00:30:08.791 --> 00:30:12.791
Booyakasha. Aku di sini bersama dengan

00:30:12.958 --> 00:30:16.083
Sherif Ken Cum Bell.

00:30:17.083 --> 00:30:18.083
Campbell.

