Aku kulit hitam!

00:31:09.291 --> 00:31:12.833
Ayahku adalah A$AP Rocky! Booyakasha!

00:31:13.291 --> 00:31:16.500
Hei, Pak Nira Cain-N'Dongeocello,

00:31:16.666 --> 00:31:19.000
kau boleh menutup mulutmu,

00:31:19.166 --> 00:31:22.166
