00:31:49.000 --> 00:31:51.458
Aku suka menjentikkan jari. Atau mungkin…

00:31:52.500 --> 00:31:54.083
Aku pilih menjentikkan jari.

00:31:54.250 --> 00:31:55.750
Apa pendapatmu tentang itu?

00:31:55.916 --> 00:31:58.458
Aku suka mengangguk, tetapi aku…

00:31:58.625 --> 00:32:01.291
Menjentikkan jari memicu reaksi emosional?

00:32:01.458 --> 00:32:02.625
Tidak memicu. Hanya…

00:32:02.791 --> 00:32:06.541
